{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2022-08-16 06:00:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT ANNOUNCES SECOND QUARTER RESULTS; REAFFIRMS FISCAL 2022 GUIDANCE', 'text': "ATLANTA , AUG. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE HOME DEPOT®, THE WORLD'S LARGEST HOME IMPROVEMENT RETAILER, TODAY REPORTED SALES OF $43.8 BILLION FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL 2022, AN INCREASE OF $2.7 BILLION, OR 6.5 PERCENT FROM THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL 2021. COMPARABLE SALES FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF FISCAL 2022 INCREASED 5.8 PERCENT, AND COMPARABLE SALES IN THE U.S. INCREASED 5.4 PERCENT."}